			<item>
				<title>Filter operators</title>
				<link>https://learn.jsonxcel.com/en/learn/m05-group-sort-filter/m05-l03-filter/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://learn.jsonxcel.com/en/learn/m05-group-sort-filter/m05-l03-filter/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;learning-objectives&#34;&gt;Learning objectives&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Know the &lt;code&gt;F=&lt;/code&gt; / filter expression syntax (&lt;code&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;AND&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;OR&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;LIKE&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;NULL&lt;/code&gt;, …)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Understand that &lt;strong&gt;JsonXcel&amp;rsquo;s JSON &lt;code&gt;ds&lt;/code&gt; path does not accept &lt;code&gt;F=&lt;/code&gt; today&lt;/strong&gt; — the engine requires a table data source&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Prefer filtering in your application before convert until table binding is exposed&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;aside&#xD;&#xA;  class=&#34;jx-lesson-demo my-8 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/80 p-5 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900/60&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  data-jx-demo&#xD;&#xA;  data-template-name=&#34;lesson_m05_filter&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  data-language=&#34;en-US&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  data-api-base=&#34;https://api.jsonxcel.com:2053&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  data-site-root=&#34;https://learn.jsonxcel.com&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  data-sample-url=&#34;https://learn.jsonxcel.com/samples/en-US/lesson_m05_filter.json&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  data-sample-kind=&#34;ds&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  data-template-url=&#34;https://learn.jsonxcel.com/templates/en-US/lesson_m05_filter.xlsx&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  data-mode=&#34;ds&#34;&#xD;&#xA;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100&#34;&gt;Interactive lesson demo&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Combined filter conditions</title>
				<link>https://learn.jsonxcel.com/en/learn/m05-group-sort-filter/m05-l04-filter-combined/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
